  "updated_at": "2026-03-27",
  "bio": "Nichelle Gabbard is an illustrative tattoo artist based in Minneapolis, United States, renowned for her professionalism. Nichelle seamlessly balances her personal life as a married mother, artist, and hobbyist with a profound dedication to her craft, ensuring that each client's experience is not only satisfying artistically but also meticulously managed from start to finish. Her studio is regarded as a beacon of cleanliness, providing peace of mind and a safe environment for all her clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Minneapolis, Minnesota, United States"
